TELL ME WHAT YOU BUILT (OPTIONAL, BUT WELCOME)

Not a condition of the license - you owe no email. But if you are using this
for something, I would genuinely like to hear about it. Open an issue on the
repository or get in touch. I am curious what people do with it.

ACCURACY AND WARRANTY

This dataset is compiled from open sources. Facility locations vary in
precision: some are building-level coordinates, many resolve only to a city,
and a portion fall back to state or country centroids. It is not verified
ground truth, it is not complete, and it should not be treated as either.
Check anything that matters before you rely on it.

